docs {
Kontribusi gambar contoh pada kata existing. Unggah file dulu lewat
POST /api/v1/images?purpose=word (GitHub), lalu kirim referensi
url + provider_file_id (+ sha opsional). Laporan bug / bukti
verifikator tetap ImageKit (upload-token terpisah).

Di sini dijalankan sebagai ADMIN: langsung published + is_verified true
(bandingkan Add Pronunciation yang pakai contributor → pending).

201 sukses (admin):

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "id": "01JDWordImage0000000000000",
        "word_id": "01JDW6XK2Q...",
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/images@main/assets/words/….jpg",
        "provider_file_id": "assets/words/….jpg",
        "alt_text": "Makan pakai tangan",
        "is_primary": false,
        "content_warnings": [],
        "status": "published",
        "is_verified": true,
        "is_corrected": false
      }
    }

content_warnings opsional (33-api-word-image-warnings.md), mis. ["kekerasan"].
}

meta {
  name: Add Word Image (Admin)
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/words/{{word_id}}/images
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

script:pre-request {
  // file id unik per run - unique (word_id, provider, provider_file_id)
  bru.setVar('bruno_media_file_id', 'bruno-' + Date.now());
}

body:json {
  {
    "url": "https://ik.imagekit.io/dev/words/makatn-2.jpg",
    "provider_file_id": "{{bruno_media_file_id}}",
    "alt_text": "Makan pakai tangan",
    "is_primary": false,
    "content_warnings": []
  }
}

tests {
  test("201 + published + is_verified true (admin self-verified)", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(201);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal('published');
    expect(res.body.data.is_verified).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.id).to.have.lengthOf(26);
  });
}
